:''For other uses, see [[Jack (disambiguation)]].''
'''Heavenly Jack''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Capsule]] during the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 557
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Heavenly Jack
|name2 = Heavenly Lord Jack
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Heavenly Lord Jack''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat can be used to take out small peons in levels or chip a boss away. Be wary though; his short range and glass health allows him to be overwhelmed by long-ranged enemies VERY quickly!

{{Job|Classification = Melee}}

